{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16966","headline":"春暮郊居寄朱舍人 · 武元衡","name":"春暮郊居寄朱舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽深不让子真居，度日闲眠世事疎。\n春水满池新雨霁，香风入户落花余。\n目随鸿雁穷苍翠，心寄溪云任卷舒。\n回首知音青琐闼，何时一爲荐相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}